WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.016 --> 00:00:16.776
recited the Tight Headband spell.

2
00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:21.858
Both Wukongs fell to the ground, howling in pain.

3
00:00:21.878 --> 00:00:24.478
"Please stop!"

4
00:00:24.618 --> 00:00:25.179
they cried.

5
00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:30.180
Guanyin stopped reciting the spell, and the two monkeys stood back up.

6
00:00:33.548 --> 00:00:35.009
The bodhisattva frowned.

7
00:00:35.029 --> 00:00:38.412
"I still don't know which of you is the real Wukong.

8
00:00:39.753 --> 00:00:40.933
should both go to Heaven.

9
00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.535
The real Wukong used to live there.

10
00:00:44.756 --> 00:00:47.418
Maybe the Jade Emperor can tell who is who."

11
00:00:49.059 --> 00:00:50.680
idea," said one Wukong.

12
00:00:51.681 --> 00:00:52.762
He pointed at the other.

13
00:00:52.962 --> 00:00:55.604
"The Jade Emperor will see that this monkey is a fake!"

14
00:00:57.365 --> 00:00:58.946
"I'm not a fake!"

15
00:00:59.126 --> 00:01:00.127
cried the other monkey.

16
00:01:00.147 --> 00:01:01.088
"You are!"

17
00:01:03.652 --> 00:01:05.453
He tried to strike the other Wukong.

18
00:01:06.153 --> 00:01:08.514
But that one dodged the blow and swung back.

19
00:01:10.635 --> 00:01:14.817
The two monkeys were still fighting when they arrived at the southern gate of Heaven.

20
00:01:18.379 --> 00:01:19.959
guard narrowed his eyes.

21
00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.860
"Wukong? Is that you?"

22
00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:26.102
"Yes, it's me," said both of the Wukongs.

23
00:01:26.122 --> 00:01:30.144
"I must speak with the Jade Emperor," said one monkey.

24
00:01:31.132 --> 00:01:32.353
pointed at the other monkey.

25
00:01:32.373 --> 00:01:34.094
"He's a fake Wukong!"

26
00:01:34.175 --> 00:01:37.037
"I'm not a fake Wukong!"

27
00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:38.217
said the other monkey.

28
00:01:39.318 --> 00:01:40.139
the real one!

29
00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:42.581
I must speak with the Jade Emperor!"

30
00:01:44.902 --> 00:01:47.504
The guard allowed both Wukongs to enter Heaven.

31
00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:52.288
Clang! Bang!

32
00:01:53.168 --> 00:01:57.672
Spirits and gods fled as the two Wukongs fought all over Heaven.

33
00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.181
The monkeys knocked over statues and trees.

34
00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:08.545
Still fighting, they stormed into the Cloud Palace.

35
00:02:10.546 --> 00:02:13.628
When the Jade Emperor saw them, he was furious.

36
00:02:13.648 --> 00:02:15.829
"What's going on?"

37
00:02:16.189 --> 00:02:16.770
he boomed.

38
00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:19.251
"Your Majesty!"

39
00:02:19.611 --> 00:02:20.912
said one of the Wukongs.

40
00:02:22.153 --> 00:02:23.013
punish this monkey.

41
00:02:23.253 --> 00:02:24.534
He's pretending to be me."

42
00:02:27.055 --> 00:02:27.756
cried the other.

43
00:02:28.244 --> 00:02:29.925
"He's pretending to be me!"

44
00:02:31.747 --> 00:02:34.769
"Stand still, both of you," said the Jade Emperor.

45
00:02:34.789 --> 00:02:37.071
"Let me get a good look at you."

46
00:02:42.055 --> 00:02:46.818
The two Wukongs stood still as the Jade Emperor looked carefully at them.

47
00:02:47.979 --> 00:02:49.721
Finally the emperor shrugged.

48
00:02:50.101 --> 00:02:51.242
look exactly alike.

49
00:02:51.962 --> 00:02:54.736
I can't tell who is who."

50
00:02:54.876 --> 00:02:57.839
One of the Wukongs swung at the other with his iron bar.

51
00:02:57.859 --> 00:03:00.321
"I'm the real Wukong!"

52
00:03:01.602 --> 00:03:04.244
"No!" The other Wukong blocked the bar and swung back.

53
00:03:05.245 --> 00:03:06.826
"I'm the real Wukong!"

54
00:03:06.846 --> 00:03:11.450
"Both of you, leave at once!"

55
00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:13.271
thundered the Jade Emperor.

56
00:03:14.312 --> 00:03:15.753
Wukong is bad enough.

57
00:03:16.994 --> 00:03:18.576
I don't want two of you around.

58
00:03:19.236 --> 00:03:20.738
You can fight somewhere else!"

59
00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:29.281
The two monkeys kept fighting as they headed out of the palace.

60
00:03:30.341 --> 00:03:32.742
The spirit of the planet Venus followed them.

61
00:03:32.762 --> 00:03:36.583
"Wukong, wait," said the spirit.

62
00:03:37.243 --> 00:03:38.944
Both monkeys stopped to look at him.

63
00:03:38.964 --> 00:03:42.465
"Go to the Land of Darkness," said Venus.

64
00:03:42.485 --> 00:03:45.986
"Maybe the Judge of the Dead can tell you apart."

65
00:03:50.267 --> 00:03:53.928
Soon the two Wukongs were standing before the Judge of the Dead.

66
00:03:55.336 --> 00:03:56.457
judge shook his head.

67
00:03:56.477 --> 00:03:58.939
"You look exactly alike."

68
00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.782
"Check the Directory," said one of the Wukongs.

69
00:04:02.802 --> 00:04:06.706
"Maybe it will have some information about a fake Sun Wukong."

70
00:04:07.646 --> 00:04:09.588
"Yes," said the other Wukong.

71
00:04:09.608 --> 00:04:11.610
"Check the Directory."

72
00:04:13.091 --> 00:04:15.873
The judge nodded and opened the Directory.

73
00:04:16.734 --> 00:04:19.836
He turned the pages of the giant book, reading carefully.

74
00:04:21.057 --> 00:04:22.518
Finally he closed it.

75
00:04:23.639 --> 00:04:27.866
"There's no 'Fake Sun Wukong' in the Directory," said the judge.

76
00:04:27.886 --> 00:04:29.588
"I'm sorry.

77
00:04:30.328 --> 00:04:34.691
But I have no idea which one of you is the real Wukong."

78
00:04:35.892 --> 00:04:37.973
A spirit was sitting at a nearby desk.

79
00:04:37.993 --> 00:04:43.917
"I believe my pet beast, Curious Ear, can help," said the spirit.

80
00:04:44.858 --> 00:04:48.981
He took a step back, and a small beast crept out from under the desk.

81
00:04:49.001 --> 00:04:54.781
"Curious Ear can tell the true from the false," said the spirit.

82
00:05:00.084 --> 00:05:02.405
The beast stared hard at the two Wukongs.

83
00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:04.767
it spoke.

84
00:05:04.787 --> 00:05:07.328
"I know who the fake Sun Wukong
